{"slug":"Universal-Script-Infinite-Yield-103818","_id":"698666811a5b231013be3df0","title":"Infinite Yield","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":"/images/sb/0-1770415745067.png","placeId":0},"features":"Infinite Yield is a very popular admin command script used in Roblox games.\n\nIt’s a powerful admin panel that lets players use commands (like teleporting, changing walk speed, flying, giving items, etc.) without needing the game creator to set them up — as long as the game allows scripts.\n\n🚀 What Infinite Yield Does\n\nInfinite Yield gives you a command box in games where scripts are allowed, and you can type commands like:\n\n:fly — Make your character fly\n\n:speed 50 — Change your walk/run speed\n\n:teleport playername — Teleport to another player\n\n:bring playername — Bring another player to you\n…and many more.\n\n⚠️ Important: Some commands only work if the game doesn’t block admin scripts, and using admin scripts in games that don’t allow them might get you kicked or banned from that game.\n\n🧠 Where It’s Used\n\nPlayers drop Infinite Yield into games to:\n\nExplore maps fast\n\nMess around with friends\n\nTest stuff\n…but it’s not meant to give unfair advantages in competitive games.","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EdgeIY/infiniteyield/master/source'))()","owner":{"_id":"681ba208605aada39a383c56","username":"Apollodahacker","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/681ba208605aada39a383c56-1772214980989.png","status":"offline","id":"681ba208605aada39a383c56","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10}},"verified":false,"views":6619,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/0-1770415745067.png","likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-02-06T22:09:05.083Z","executes":13480,"keyless":false,"milestones":[{"key":"script.executions","tier":10000,"value":11006,"at":"2026-09-29T05:45:0